# The vertical spellings at a permission question
# (APPROVAL-VERTICAL-SPELLINGS). fx v0.0.16 moves the choice on the plain
# arrows alone. Shift-, Ctrl-, Super- and Alt-Up and -Down (Alt also as
# kitty's report of the arrow) are composer moves and C-p and C-n raw bytes
# the question does not read (input_approval_runtime.zig:111-128,
# escape_parser.zig:73-108, src/ui/input/runtime.zig:61-108@481104fd).
# First in an amendment on choice 1 holding `ab cd`, each key and then a
# letter: the amendment stays open, Super-Up and Super-Down take the caret
# to the draft's start and end, and the other ten leave it where it is. Then
# Down and Up to choice 1 with no amendment open, and each key again: the
# choice stays on 1. Enter last answers it, with the draft it holds.
# Not here: `ESC ESC [ A` (fx's meta prefix), which xfx reads as Escape and
# Up; the Escape cancels the turn (owner QUESTION-LEFT-SPELLINGS).
# The turns, the workspace and the settings are approvals.cap's.
fx: gateway approvals-fx.json
xfx: gateway approvals-xfx.json
work approvals-ws
fx: seed approvals-fx-settings.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
wait 3
type edit the files
key Enter
wait 3
snap ask
key Tab
wait 0.4
type ab cd
wait 0.4
key S-Up
wait 0.4
type x
wait 0.4
snap amend-shift-up
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 41
wait 0.4
type y
wait 0.4
snap amend-super-up
key -H 10
wait 0.4
type w
wait 0.4
snap amend-ctrl-p
key S-Down
wait 0.4
type v
wait 0.4
snap amend-shift-down
key C-Up
wait 0.4
type u
wait 0.4
snap amend-ctrl-up
key C-Down
wait 0.4
type t
wait 0.4
snap amend-ctrl-down
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 33 41
wait 0.4
type s
wait 0.4
snap amend-alt-up
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 33 42
wait 0.4
type r
wait 0.4
snap amend-alt-down
key -H 1b 5b 35 37 33 35 32 3b 33 75
wait 0.4
type q
wait 0.4
snap amend-kitty-alt-up
key -H 1b 5b 35 37 33 35 33 3b 33 75
wait 0.4
type p
wait 0.4
snap amend-kitty-alt-down
key -H 0e
wait 0.4
type o
wait 0.4
snap amend-ctrl-n
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 42
wait 0.4
type n
wait 0.4
snap amend-super-down
key Down
key Up
wait 0.4
snap choice-1
# Down and Up alternate after the first two, so a key that moved the
# choice (as each did before this unit) leaves it on 2 or 3 at every
# snap but the last: six steps each way come back to 1.
key S-Down
wait 0.4
snap shift-down
key C-Down
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-down
key S-Up
wait 0.4
snap shift-up
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 42
wait 0.4
snap super-down
key C-Up
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-up
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 33 42
wait 0.4
snap alt-down
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 41
wait 0.4
snap super-up
key -H 1b 5b 35 37 33 35 33 3b 33 75
wait 0.4
snap kitty-alt-down
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 33 41
wait 0.4
snap alt-up
key -H 0e
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-n
key -H 1b 5b 35 37 33 35 32 3b 33 75
wait 0.4
snap kitty-alt-up
key -H 10
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-p
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap answered
